-- Sacred Waters of Eldre'thalas
    -- Eldre'thalas = Eldre'thalas. Moonwells -> ay kuyuları, well -> kuyu. Elune = Elune.
    -- Twin set -> ikiz set. Dire Maul -> Katmerli Ezgi (Dire Maul)[cite: 2]. Ogres -> Ogreler.
